----boundary-LibPST-iamunique-730507096_-_-
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="windows-1252"

Dear Governor Bush,
 
This email is for your information only. I would like for your office to note that Sanford Minkoff, Lake County Attorney will not respond to my email requesting:
 
1.  emergency meeting of the Affordable Housing Advisory Committee to discuss issues such as mismanagement of funds, use of unlicensed contractors, not being able to provide homeowners with releases of liens, general contractors with bad checks to suppliers, general contractors with active drug convictions, general contractors stealing tools from homeowers, Lake County firing employees that expose unlicensed, unpermitted activity, unlicensed contractors stealing legitimate contractors license numbers and passing them off fraudently as their own, etc.....you would think the advisory board would wish to discuss these issues as they may lead to the removal of the SHIP funds designated for Lake County, Florida.
 
2.    We would like these topics to be added to the agenda of the Lake County Commission for public discussion...Commissioners refuse to give Attorney Minkoff an answer.
 
3.  Phone numbers of Affordable Housing Advisory Committee members.
 
I will keep your office posted as to the progress......or lack of............. as it happens.
 
Thank you,
 
Debbie Smith

