Date: Mon, 7 Nov 2005 09:02:42 EST
Subject: Emergency Meeting of Affordable Housiency Meeting of Affordable Housing Advisory Committee
To: SMinkoff@co.lake.fl.us
CC: Jeb.Bush@MyFlorida.com, kwaltz@orlandosentinel.com, president@flabar.org
X-Mailer: 9.0 SE for Windows sub 5021
