	boundary="--boundary-LibPST-iamunique-720582017_-_-"


----boundary-LibPST-iamunique-720582017_-_-
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="windows-1252"

Good Morning Sanford,
 
Just checking in to see if you had scheduled that emergency meeting I requested of the Affordable Housing Advisory Committee. Also I need those phone numbers of the members or location where I can find those that are not listed in the phone book.....since it is a matter of public record.
 
Please allow enough room for the public and/or media if they wish to attend.
 
Thank you.
 
Debbie Smith

